<view class="page"
  ><view class="title">分享你的发现。</view
  ><view class="muted">写清楚目标、尝试过程和遇到的问题，更容易获得帮助。</view
  ><input
    placeholder="标题（6–120 字）"
    maxlength="120"
    value="{{title}}"
    data-field="title"
    bindinput="field"
  /><picker range="{{categories}}" value="{{category}}" bindchange="category"
    ><view class="card">{{categories[category]}} ▾</view></picker
  ><textarea
    placeholder="正文（10–20000 字）"
    style="min-height: 600rpx"
    value="{{body}}"
    data-field="body"
    bindinput="field"
    maxlength="20000"
  /><view class="tiny"
    >请勿发布侵权、骚扰、广告或个人隐私内容。管理员可处理违规内容。</view
  ><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice">{{error}}</view
  ><button
    class="primary"
    bindtap="submit"
    loading="{{loading}}"
    disabled="{{loading}}"
  >
    发布讨论
  </button></view
>
